<title>CROATIA: Croatia May RPI up to 0.4 pct mo/mo, down yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Croatia May RPI up to 0.4 pct mo/mo, down yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA RETAIL PRICES	(MONTH)   (PREVIOUS)   (YEAR AGO)</p>
<p> monthly change (pct)	  +0.4	 +0.1	   +1.1</p>
<p> year-on-year		    +3.6	 +4.4	   +3.3</p>
<p>NOTES -- Croatia introduced a radical anti-inflation programme in October 1993, when monthly inflation hit 38.7 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
